OL,3,GNEWSACall for more detail over chemical
OL,4,Aplant blood tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire County Council's director of
OL,7,Fpublic health has requested more
OL,8,Finformation about blood tests carried
OL,9,Fout on residents living near a chemical
OL,10,Fplant.
OL,12,FForty-nine residents, living near the
OL,13,FAGC Chemicals factory in
OL,14,FThornton-Cleveleys have been told their
OL,15,Fblood test readings showed 70% had
OL,16,Fincreased levels of PFOA, a forever
OL,17,Fchemical which can increase the risk of
OL,18,Fserious health conditions including
OL,19,Fcancer.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40202
SC,0002
