OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1790675756
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACall for more detail over chemical
OL,4,Aplant blood tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe independent tests were jointly
OL,7,Ffunded by law firm Watershed and Law
OL,8,Ffor Change.
OL,10,FDr Sakthi Karunanithi wants to know how
OL,11,Fthose tests were conducted and the
OL,12,Fstandards followed, so he can fulfil
OL,13,Fhis public health duties and ensure
OL,14,Fresidents are protected, he told BBC
OL,15,FRadio Lancashire.
